# hw-bluestep.steps -- the blue footstep puff of an invisible player, for
# tools/hw-drive.sh.  This is the live check for issue #309: the HexenWorld
# gamecode sends svc_particle4 with wire type 28 (newplay.hc, dropStep), and
# the client must draw it as pale blue specks around a translucent footprint.
# Before the fix they came out as red fire.
#
# dropStep only runs for a player who is invisible and moving on the ground,
# so: take every artifact, use invisibility, look at the floor, walk.
#
# impulse 43 is the everything cheat (needs deathmatch 0, coop 0, skill < 3).
# impulse 107 uses inventory slot 8, INV_INVISIBILITY (100 + slot - 1).
cmd impulse 43
sleep 1
cmd impulse 107
sleep 1
shot 01-invisible
cmd +lookdown
sleep 1
cmd -lookdown
cmd +forward
shotf walk-1
shotf walk-2
shotf walk-3
shotf walk-4
shotf walk-5
shotf walk-6
shotf walk-7
shotf walk-8
cmd -forward
shot 02-stopped
